Subject: [PATCH] welle-e2: switch programmes without retuning the ensemble

Add a generation-aware SELECT/READY/START handshake over stdin and metadata.
Keep the SDR input, OFDM/FIC receiver and packet services alive while replacing
the selected audio decoder.

Upstream-Status: Pending

